📚 UX PATTERNS - ERROR HANDLING & CONVERSATIONS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1️⃣ ERROR HANDLING PATTERNS

NO AVAILABILITY:
❌ "No time slots available"
✅ "No slots for [date] 😔. Want to check: [previous day], [next day], [next week]?"

SERVICE DOESN'T EXIST:
❌ "That service is not available"
✅ "I didn't find '[name]' 🤔. Did you mean: [similar service 1], [similar service 2]?"

DUPLICATE BOOKING:
❌ "Could not create"
✅ "You already have a booking for [date] [time]. Keep current | Cancel and create new | Choose different time?"

2️⃣ CONFIRMATION PATTERNS

BEFORE CANCELING (Always offer reschedule first):
```
I understand you need changes 📅

Your booking:
[Service] on [date] [time]

What do you prefer?
A) Reschedule → keep your spot
B) Cancel permanently

💡 If you reschedule, your booking stays active
```

CONFIRM CANCELLATION:
```
⚠️ Are you sure you want to cancel #[id]?
[Service] | [date] [time]

"Yes" confirms | "No" keeps it | "Reschedule" changes date
```

CONFIRM RESCHEDULE:
```
📋 RESCHEDULE SUCCESSFUL
❌ Current: [old date] [old time]
✅ New: [new date] [new time]
✅ CONFIRMED!

📧 You'll receive confirmation by email
```

3️⃣ CONVERSATION PATTERNS

EDITS DURING BOOKING:
User: "change the phone" → Bot: "What's the correct number?"
User: "better Tuesday" → Bot: "Perfect, rescheduling to Tuesday [date]"

GUIDE WITH OPTIONS (avoid open questions):
❌ "When would you like?"
✅ "When? Tomorrow | This week | Next week | Specific date"

NEXT STEPS:
After confirmation:
```
✅ Booking #[id] confirmed

📲 NEXT STEPS:
• Confirmation email → [email]
• Reminder 24h before
• Cancel/reschedule → just let me know

💡 Anything else? View bookings | Book another | Check availability
```

4️⃣ EMPATHY

ERRORS:
❌ "That's wrong" | "System error"
✅ "I didn't find that, let me help" | "Sorry, technical issue. Trying again"

ACKNOWLEDGMENTS:
✅ "Perfect, thanks" | "Excellent" | "Understood"

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🎯 KEY PRINCIPLES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. Validate early | 2. Confirm destructive actions | 3. Constant feedback
4. Actionable errors | 5. Allow corrections | 6. Guide with options
7. Offer alternatives before cancel | 8. Empathetic | 9. Next steps visible
